# P12 round 5: Patch Vary on Tracker+ (the MK66 patch editor F4). Instr held + Up x3 picks Synth 1, the Instrument Parameters key opens the
# Synth screen, F8 the patch editor. Shift + encoder +1 x2 moves the amount from 10 % to 20 % (the label's second line, the trace reads it), F4 varies the patch (popup
# "Vary 20%"), Shift + F4 takes it back (popup "Vary undone"). plus_flows.sh reads the part afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_VARY): the amount
# reaches 20, the values move away and end where they started.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh plus
title: Patch Vary on Tracker+ (P12)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
tap Params
wait 1200ms
tap F8
wait 1500ms
expect text "Edit Patch"
expect text "Vary"
press Shift
wait 300ms
enc +1
wait 300ms
enc +1
wait 300ms
release Shift
wait 400ms
tap F4
wait 600ms
expect text "Vary 20%"
shot vary
wait 1500ms
press Shift
wait 300ms
tap F4
wait 300ms
release Shift
wait 600ms
expect text "Vary undone"
